    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a practical, hands-on relationship with math through economics and daily problem-solving. My lower secondary education gave me foundational skills, but I now use math in contexts like budgeting and understanding data trends. It’s not my passion, but it’s a useful tool for real-world decisions.",
